# pause-unpause@rpcache: unpause with only cache-drawn terrain in the scene
# (terrain, Spyro and the 2D layer selected, 4:3, cache forced on): the pause
# freeze stayed up because cache-owned terrain did not count as world.
# Blessed pre-fix.
